															<img decoding="async" width="799" height="533" src="/wp-content/uploads/bubble-wall.avif" class="attachment-large size-large wp-image-114518" alt="" srcset="/wp-content/uploads/bubble-wall-100x100.avif 100w, /wp-content/uploads/bubble-wall-300x200.avif 300w, /wp-content/uploads/bubble-wall-600x400.avif 600w, /wp-content/uploads/bubble-wall-768x512.avif 768w, /wp-content/uploads/bubble-wall.avif 799w" sizes="(max-width: 799px) 100vw, 799px" />															</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-6b4eb03 elementor-widget elementor-widget-theme-post-content" data-id="6b4eb03" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="theme-post-content.default">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Installing bubble walls means setting up a space that is not only particularly suggestive from an aesthetic point of view but also increases the comfort of your business if you decide to install these splendid <a href="/bubble-walls/">bubble walls</a> in your company. These cascades, perfect in commercial contexts, allow you to enhance the spaces while taking on an attractive symbolic value to achieve peace and serenity.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Bubble Walls: General Characteristics</strong></h2>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">As is known, water refers to the deepest meaning of life, purity, and total well-being. The presence of this element is fundamental in any property. For this reason, it will be possible to install a bubble wall with an exclusive design to obtain a whole series of benefits.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Indoor bubble walls are nothing more than an architectural element in line with the latest design trends; they also perform various practical functions, as they can effectively separate spaces without obstructing the passage of light. Bubble walls are very interesting for decorating spaces that would otherwise be bare or anonymous. They are supplied with regular or colored LED lights.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The range of bubble walls to be placed indoors is wider than you might imagine. It includes models made with different materials that adapt well to any style and finish already present in the room. Safe and suitable for all, bubble walls can also create micro bubbles that enchant you. The water bubbles score a &#8220;wow&#8221; effect on your guests and make the environment more live able and balanced.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<h2 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Why </strong>B<strong>ubble Walls Appeal Us</strong></h2>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">We are made of 80% water. Water gives harmony and well-being to the body and mind. It is no coincidence that the Orientals (attentive to the balance of body and mind) were the precursors of using these objects in domestic and business environments.</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The bubble walls are presented as more or less compact panels with water flowing inside tubular sections and the most singular shapes. However, there is no shortage of original creations, such as the unique spheres or the windows, which are also customizable with a hypnotic effect. In any case, the flow of water generated by these refined complements produces a particularly pleasant rustling that promotes calm, concentration, and relaxation. The installation of the <a href="/bubble-walls/">bubble wall</a> is quite quick and does not require any masonry work or other invasive interventions, as it is sufficient to immerse the pump and connect it to the electricity. There is no problem even with regard to maintenance since it is really minimal</p>
<h3 class="wp-block-heading"><strong>Technical Characteristics</strong></h3>
<ul class="wp-block-list">
<li>The body is transparent plexiglass, while the base and the lid are black or white.</li>
<li>Extremely compact and silent, the bubble walls do not require any connection to the water system. They are managed by an integrated ventilation system inserted inside the base and, therefore, invisible.</li>
<li>Given its characteristics, this design object can be placed in any domestic or work environment as a partition or refined decorative element.</li>
<li>The frame contains RGB LEDs whose color can be changed using the control provided.</li>
<li>Maintenance is minimal, but distilled water should be used correctly.</li>
</ul>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"></p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Then, indoor bubble walls when equipped with RGB LEDs or variable color on command, which can be adjusted according to specific preferences. Thanks to these, you can create fascinating light games and unique, exciting atmospheres.</p>
